    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Who's Who 2.0 is causal, party battle royale genre game which have elevated the fun of the battle to another level. </strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>You will have to find real players lurking among the NPCs and kick them out of the game with your new skills! find your own psychological and strategical way to be the last man standing!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Game modes</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>  </strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3391260/extras/1f37cbd7221cc2acb5cdeb97f7be850d.avif?t=1755538930\" width=800 height=516 /></span></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Last man Standing - Find all the real players and be the last man standing!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3391260/extras/7062051d11a924eb7eeb9525a302fe7c.avif?t=1755538930\" width=800 height=516 /></span></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Team rumble - Find all opposing teammates while protecting and reviving your teammates!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3391260/extras/accb8773c52ab39a1f119f819551f14f.avif?t=1755538930\" width=800 height=516 /></span></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>No skill mode - Enjoy the classic Who's Who where nobody can use their skills. </strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3391260/extras/b25d01f366a6b40a5cd0d10fc8dcc2b6.avif?t=1755538930\" width=800 height=516 /></span></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Bombsaway - Stay alive until all the bombs go off! If you have the bomb with you, toss the bomb to another player and run away from it! Only the players with the bomb could attack other players.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3391260/extras/0743ec6cddc69c56530dfc84b2e2e640.avif?t=1755538930\" width=800 height=516 /></span></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong> Event mode - collect gifts that are being spawned throughout the map! every 90 seconds, the gifts that you have collected will turn in to an actual object. You can attack the other players to collect the gifts they have gathered so far. </strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3391260/extras/e6f6cc7e728ce92fe1cea6624542256a.avif?t=1755538930\" width=800 height=516 /></span></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Character Test Lab mode - The mode will change on seasonal basis, This mode is to test and get used to the new characters. </strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Tag along all streamers and creators!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>We are open towards any business opportunities!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>If you wish us to create your illustrated characters, Let us know!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>We are looking forward on making solid partnership with all of you!</strong></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Who's Who 2.0 is causal, party battle royale genre game which have elevated the fun of the battle to another level. </strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>You will have to find real players lurking among the NPCs and kick them out of the game with your new skills! find your own psychological and strategical way to be the last man standing!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Game modes</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>  </strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3391260/extras/1f37cbd7221cc2acb5cdeb97f7be850d.avif?t=1755538930\" width=800 height=516 /></span></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Last man Standing - Find all the real players and be the last man standing!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3391260/extras/7062051d11a924eb7eeb9525a302fe7c.avif?t=1755538930\" width=800 height=516 /></span></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Team rumble - Find all opposing teammates while protecting and reviving your teammates!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3391260/extras/accb8773c52ab39a1f119f819551f14f.avif?t=1755538930\" width=800 height=516 /></span></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>No skill mode - Enjoy the classic Who's Who where nobody can use their skills. </strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3391260/extras/b25d01f366a6b40a5cd0d10fc8dcc2b6.avif?t=1755538930\" width=800 height=516 /></span></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Bombsaway - Stay alive until all the bombs go off! If you have the bomb with you, toss the bomb to another player and run away from it! Only the players with the bomb could attack other players.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3391260/extras/0743ec6cddc69c56530dfc84b2e2e640.avif?t=1755538930\" width=800 height=516 /></span></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong> Event mode - collect gifts that are being spawned throughout the map! every 90 seconds, the gifts that you have collected will turn in to an actual object. You can attack the other players to collect the gifts they have gathered so far. </strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3391260/extras/e6f6cc7e728ce92fe1cea6624542256a.avif?t=1755538930\" width=800 height=516 /></span></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Character Test Lab mode - The mode will change on seasonal basis, This mode is to test and get used to the new characters. </strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Tag along all streamers and creators!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>We are open towards any business opportunities!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>If you wish us to create your illustrated characters, Let us know!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>We are looking forward on making solid partnership with all of you!</strong></p>",
    "short_description": "Who's Who 2.0 is back with brand new team! Looking for another dynamic party game? Each characters now holds unique skills which now will impact each modes with its own advantages! You can play solo, or party up with your friends and become the winner by eliminating the real players among the NPCs.",
